  "description": "Account store + authentication for SetNet: a generic AccountServer<TAccount> over any IDocumentStore (memory/file/SQL/Mongo). Register/authenticate with a pluggable password hasher (PBKDF2 default), ban/unban, change password. Subclass AccountBase (or use its Extra bag) to add ANY custom fields with no schema change. Pairs with SetNet.LoginServer. Depends on SetNet + SetNet.Persistence.",
